msgid "No proprietary NVIDIA driver is blacklisting nouveau, so it is already the driver in use. There is nothing to change."
msgstr "Niciun driver proprietar NVIDIA nu blocheaza nouveau, deci este deja driverul folosit. Nu este nimic de schimbat."

msgid "NVIDIA Driver Detected"
msgstr "Driver NVIDIA detectat"

msgid "The installed NVIDIA driver keeps nouveau blacklisted, so nouveau cannot load while it is present.\n\nTo switch to nouveau, the NVIDIA drivers have to be removed. This will:\n\n1. Remove all NVIDIA and CUDA packages, their DKMS modules and the NVIDIA repository.\n2. Regenerate the initramfs and update GRUB.\n\nNouveau needs no installation: it ships with the kernel and takes over once the blacklist is gone.\n\nA system restart will be required.\n\nDo you want to remove the NVIDIA drivers?"
msgstr "Driverul NVIDIA instalat mentine nouveau pe lista neagra, asa ca nouveau nu se poate incarca cat timp este prezent.\n\nPentru a trece la nouveau, driverele NVIDIA trebuie eliminate. Aceasta operatiune va:\n\n1. Elimina toate pachetele NVIDIA si CUDA, modulele lor DKMS si depozitul NVIDIA.\n2. Regenera initramfs si actualiza GRUB.\n\nNouveau nu necesita instalare: vine cu kernelul si preia controlul imediat ce lista neagra dispare.\n\nVa fi necesara repornirea sistemului.\n\nDoriti sa eliminati driverele NVIDIA?"
